/Assuming you have a list of numbers called ListNumbers, 
/write a MARIE program that reads and displays all the numbers 
/from the list and stops as soon as it encounters the number 0.
/Ex,
/ListNumbers = {1, 44, -3, 22, 0, 55}
Load StartAddr
Store pointer

Loop,   LoadI pointer
        Skipcond 0c00     / 如果不等于0，就跳过下一行
        Halt
        Output
        Load pointer
        Add One
        Store pointer
        Jump Loop

StartAddr,      ADR ListNumbers
pointer,        hex 0
ListNumbers,    dec 1
                dec 44
                dec -3
                dec 22
                dec 0
                dec 55
One,            dec 1